+## Deployment
+
+Fizzy can be deployed to a single Linux server with Docker and
+[Kamal](https://kamal-deploy.org). The included configuration runs the web
+server, background jobs, SQLite databases, and uploaded files in one container
+behind an SSL-terminating proxy.
+
+Fill in your hostname and SMTP mail server settings in
+[`config/deploy.yml`](config/deploy.yml), provide your secrets, then run:
+
+```sh
+bin/kamal setup
+```
+
+See the [Deployment guide](docs/deployment.md) for the full walkthrough.
+
 
